只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Codex-style conversation outline for DeepSeek Harness Web: a right-edge rail with hover preview and click-to-jump","id":"gh:1335955339","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-conversation-outline","slug":"lzbaclz/dsh-conversation-outline","topics":["conversation","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","outline"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Codex-style conversation outline for DeepSeek Harness Web: a right-edge rail with hover preview and "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"onversation outline for DeepSeek Harness Web: a right-edge rail with hover preview and click-to-jump"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-conversation-outline"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"简体中文 · Usage · Troubleshooting · Security · Publishing Guide · Design Spec"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Find any question. Jump to any answer.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Long agent conversations scroll forever. `dsh-conversation-outline` is a\nCodex-style **conversation "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"outline** for DeepSeek Harness Web:\na slim, always-visible **right-edge rail** — one bar per questio"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"n, like a minimap of the\nconversation — that **expands on hover** into a preview panel of every ques"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"tion's opening\nwords. Click a bar or a row and you are teleported to that message in the Chat view, "},{"id":"p5s5","text":"with\na flash highlight so you cannot miss it. Bilingual zh-CN / en."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Right-edge rail (minimap)** — thin, pinned to the right edge, one bar per question in\nchronologi"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"cal order. Out of the way while you read; >60 questions fold into a `+N` marker.\n- **Hover to previe"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"w** — hover the rail and the panel slides out with each question's\nopening words (single-line trunca"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ted), `#turn` badge and `HH:MM` time. Collapses 240 ms\nafter you move away. Pure overlay — your cont"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"ent never shifts.\n- **Click to open as well** — clicking the strip (or a bar) pins the panel open un"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"til you\nclose it with `Esc`, the ×, or a click outside, so the rail also works on touch, pen and\naut"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"omation where no hover event ever arrives.\n- **Click-to-jump** — switches to the Chat view (even fro"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"m Trajectory), scrolls to the\nmessage and flashes it for 1.8 s. Respects `prefers-reduced-motion`; a"},{"id":"p7s9","text":" jump that cannot\nreach the message reports it in the panel instead of failing silently.\n- **Search "},{"id":"p7s10","text":"& load older** — case-insensitive filtering, plus paging into older history.\n- **Live** — new questi"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"ons appear while the session runs; follows the current session and\ncollapses on switch.\n- **Zero dep"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"endencies at runtime** — the browser bundle imports only React (the platform\nmodules); everything el"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"se is inlined and purity-checked at build time."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"> **Requirements**: DSH ≥ `0.1.5-rc.2` (the `next` channel / the DSH Desktop app).\n>\n> | Plugin vers"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ion | Works with |\n> |---|---|\n> | `0.2.x` | DSH ≥ `0.1.5-rc.2` |\n> | `0.1.2` and earlier | DSH `0.1"},{"id":"p9s3","text":".0-rc.x` (the Chat node graph still lived in `snapshot.chat`) |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"> **Using the DSH Desktop app?** Run the same command in the app's built-in\n> terminal **without `--"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"profile`** — it targets the `desktop` profile\n> automatically. The first install needs one restart o"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"f that DSH; later upgrades\n> hot-reload (no restart)."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Prerequisites**: DeepSeek Harness\n(`dsh` available) **≥ 0.1.5-rc.2**; Node.js `^22.19` or `>=24`; "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"pnpm 10+.\nIf you run DSH via `npx`, prefix the commands with `npx -p @deepseek-ai/dsh `.\nOn an older"},{"id":"p11s3","text":" host, use plugin `0.1.3` — see the\ncompatibility table."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"> **Zero build scripts on the GitHub path**: the built `lib/` is committed to this repo\n> (`.gitigno"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"re` deliberately does not ignore it), so a `github:` install fetches\n> ready-to-load artifacts — no "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"`prepare` script, no profile `allowBuilds` configuration.\n> **Name warning**: an unrelated project o"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"wns the *unscoped* npm name\n> `dsh-conversation-outline`. This plugin is only published as\n> `@chest"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"nut23/dsh-conversation-outline` — always install the scoped name (or the\n> GitHub path above)."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**After installing**: restart the DSH Web service and refresh the page (`link:` installs\njust need a"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" page refresh after `pnpm build`). Confirm with:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Upgrade with the same `add` command (optionally pin a version:\n`@chestnut23/dsh-conversation-outline"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ith the same `add` command (optionally pin a version:\n`@chestnut23/dsh-conversation-outline@0.1.4`)."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Upgrade & hot reload"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The DSH composition always mounts the `dsh-client-hmr` chain, which watches\ninstalled plugin bundles"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"n always mounts the `dsh-client-hmr` chain, which watches\ninstalled plugin bundles and reloads them:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **Upgrading an installed plugin** (same entry, new file content) is hot — no app\nrestart, usually "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"not even a page refresh.\n- **Installing a brand-new plugin** (a new roster entry) needs one DSH rest"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"even a page refresh.\n- **Installing a brand-new plugin** (a new roster entry) needs one DSH restart."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Every side effect (style tag, locale dictionaries, slot registrations) is owned by\nthe plugin fiber,"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" so a hot reload never leaves stale code behind."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Relationship to the built-in Turn navigation rail"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"DSH 0.1.5 renders its own right-edge rail (`TurnNavigatorRail`) that marks every\n**turn** and labels"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" its ticks `Turn N`: its prompt-preview field is empty, so the\nticks never show what you asked (a me"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"asured session had 72 turns and 2\nquestions), and 20x10px text-less ticks cannot say which question "},{"id":"p23s4","text":"ssion had 72 turns and 2\nquestions), and 20x10px text-less ticks cannot say which question is which."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"While this plugin is loaded it therefore hides that rail (identified by\n`nav[aria-label]`, plus a st"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ructural fallback for rebuilt views; the marker is\nre-applied through a MutationObserver) and owns t"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"he right edge itself. The change\nis fully reversible:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- unloading the plugin restores the built-in rail automatically;\n- keep it visible alongside this pl"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ugin with\n`<html data-dsh-outline-keep-turn-nav>` (e.g. from a browser console:\n`document.documentEl"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ement.setAttribute('data-dsh-outline-keep-turn-nav','')`)."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Install, restart, open any session that already has messages — a thin strip appears on\nthe right edg"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"e. Hover it to preview questions; click the strip (or a bar) to open the\npanel and keep it open; cli"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ck a row to jump; search to filter, `Load older` to page\nthrough history. Full walkthrough: docs/usa"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"ge.md. Something's not\nshowing up? Troubleshooting."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"> Real-screenshot placeholder: after installing, drop a screenshot of the rail + panel\n> at `assets/"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ui.png` and it will appear here."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"`pnpm typecheck` needs `lib/types/**` from the `@deepseek-ai/*` packages. Some DSH\ninstallations shi"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"p those packages **without** declaration files (the Electron bundle\nprunes them), and the npm `rc` c"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"hannels publish a reduced type surface — in that case\ntypecheck reports missing modules while the bu"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"ild and runtime are unaffected. The\nsupported fix is to run against a DSH source checkout (or a prof"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"e unaffected. The\nsupported fix is to run against a DSH source checkout (or a profile whose\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
